it 3-tier tie-breaking rules.\",\n      \"Pages 13-14, Section 9 ('角色差異、時段偏好與參與障礙'): Subgroup comparisons (frontline vs admin, n=4 each), condition distribution, and coded barrier frequency table.\",\n      \"Pages 14-15, Section 10 ('發現、證據強度與可執行建議'): 4 data-backed findings, evidence boundary disclaimers, and 6-item actionable recommendation tracking table.\",\n      \"Pages 15-17, Section 11 \u0026 Appendices: Official requirement traceability index, 6-step authentic replacement procedure, audit checklist, and title-blind validation guidelines.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"criteria\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion\": \"Title-blind requirement fit (I09-E03: 針對需求單位進行訪談並留有紀錄與統計分析)\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n      \"evidence_locators\": [\n        \"Page 2, Section 1\",\n        \"Pages 4-5, Section 4\",\n        \"Pages 5-6, Section 5\",\n        \"Pages 6-10, Section 6\",\n        \"Pages 11-13, Sections 7-8\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"When document titles are masked, the content functions unequivocally as a structured needs interview instrument, completed interview response registry, and statistical analysis report directly satisfying official requirement I09-E03.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion\": \"Negative-neighbor distinction (0042 / I09-E02 \u0026 0044 / I09-E04)\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n      \"evidence_locators\": [\n        \"Page 2, Section 1 ('與相關鄰工作成果的差別')\",\n        \"Page 16, Section 11 ('品質限制與禁止推論')\",\n        \"Page 16, Appendix 1 ('遮蔽標題後的用途核對')\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The document strictly preserves evidence boundaries. It disclaims being a meeting minute or curriculum review record (avoiding merger with 0042) and contains no trainer, vendor, or material procurement/evaluation procedures (avoiding merger with 0044).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"criterion\": \"Direct operational usability by 原始點協會\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n      \"evidence_locators\": [\n        \"Page 3, Section 2\",\n        \"Page 4, Section 3\",\n    